cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Liu Threshold Analyzer
message: >-
  If you use this software in work that you publish, please cite both the
  software and the method it implements.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: ASH
repository-code: https://github.com/ashbmstu/Liu
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A Windows desktop tool that extracts the laser ablation threshold fluence and
  the Gaussian beam waist diameter from a series of crater-diameter
  measurements, by ordinary least squares on squared crater diameter against
  the logarithm of pulse energy.
keywords:
  - laser ablation
  - threshold fluence
  - Gaussian beam
  - beam waist
  - linear regression
references:
  - type: article
    title: Simple technique for measurements of pulsed Gaussian-beam spot sizes
    authors:
      - family-names: Liu
        given-names: J. M.
    journal: Optics Letters
    volume: 7
    issue: 5
    start: 196
    year: 1982
    doi: 10.1364/OL.7.000196
